OL,3,GNEWSANew crossing replaces patrol
OL,4,Aoutside city primary
OL,5,
OL,6,FA much-needed crossing has been
OL,7,Finstalled outside a primary school in
OL,8,FPeterborough following calls from
OL,9,Fresidents and councillors for improved
OL,10,Froad safety.
OL,12,FThe crossing has been added outside
OL,13,FNewark Hill Academy, on Eastfield Road,
OL,14,Fbetween Parnwell and the city centre.
OL,16,FThe school previously had a crossing
OL,17,Fpatrol officer, but the role was
OL,18,Fremoved as part of Peterborough City
OL,19,FCouncil's 2024-25 budget cuts.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
